    /begin MEASUREMENT ZFFSAB._.CDD_IEP_Control.ctl_IEP_Status "Bit coded error flags indicating an error in IEP or communicating to IEP: 0=no error :: errors bit31..bit24=ErrorByte1 bit23..bit16=ErrorByte0 bit13=SWNrErr bit12=HWNrErr bit9=CRC8Err bit8=BusOff bit7=NotReceived bit6..5=- bit4=AliveCnt bit3=LIN Chksum..."
